    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2467890/extras/f91648bbc3f2ed0dc64656e1a8f8bde4.avif?t=1699182910\" /></span><br>Ever dreamt of managing 1, maybe 2, who knows? Possibly a 100 pet shops! Now that's possible without the real life risk. Sell Pet food, Pet toys, a lot of accessories for pets and even breed pets. You can also find homes for stray pets.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2467890/extras/1c8495f0155cf403bdbafd709cf30e8a.avif?t=1699182910\" /></span><br>Want to have a plant, or a custom sign, maybe you want a wall there? Everything is possible because you can organise your stores the way you like!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2467890/extras/86c55691b67aed38fdadd52284e0ca1b.avif?t=1699182910\" /></span><br>You can open so may stores (up to 15000 to be precise), the possibilities are endless. You can have a store in every part of the world!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2467890/extras/2e1946ef2a0fb349db3b37b3de8e6e03.avif?t=1699182910\" /></span><br>You should hire the right employees which won't steal from the cash register. Running 15000 pet shops may become overwhelming, but don't worry! You can always hire a manager!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2467890/extras/0c08c87402ab7ca3ec21dd5893da2a16.avif?t=1699182910\" /></span><br>Sign contracts with the best companies whose products people will buy! But be careful, there is a penalty if you don't sell enough products.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2467890/extras/cf90460d7dc38dd4079c5beeb540c762.avif?t=1699182910\" /></span><br>Go to the R&amp;D department and research everything from e-commerce to pets selling, everything is possible!",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2467890/extras/f91648bbc3f2ed0dc64656e1a8f8bde4.avif?t=1699182910\" /></span><br>Ever dreamt of managing 1, maybe 2, who knows? Possibly a 100 pet shops! Now that's possible without the real life risk. Sell Pet food, Pet toys, a lot of accessories for pets and even breed pets. You can also find homes for stray pets.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2467890/extras/1c8495f0155cf403bdbafd709cf30e8a.avif?t=1699182910\" /></span><br>Want to have a plant, or a custom sign, maybe you want a wall there? Everything is possible because you can organise your stores the way you like!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2467890/extras/86c55691b67aed38fdadd52284e0ca1b.avif?t=1699182910\" /></span><br>You can open so may stores (up to 15000 to be precise), the possibilities are endless. You can have a store in every part of the world!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2467890/extras/2e1946ef2a0fb349db3b37b3de8e6e03.avif?t=1699182910\" /></span><br>You should hire the right employees which won't steal from the cash register. Running 15000 pet shops may become overwhelming, but don't worry! You can always hire a manager!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2467890/extras/0c08c87402ab7ca3ec21dd5893da2a16.avif?t=1699182910\" /></span><br>Sign contracts with the best companies whose products people will buy! But be careful, there is a penalty if you don't sell enough products.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2467890/extras/cf90460d7dc38dd4079c5beeb540c762.avif?t=1699182910\" /></span><br>Go to the R&amp;D department and research everything from e-commerce to pets selling, everything is possible!",
